# headwear/helm/crested_crest: the crested helm's crest (P2c slice, SLICE-HELM-SHIELD): a horsehair brush in the plume slot
# (plumeColor; 0 = the tabard's colour) on a steel holder along the crown, front to back, its tail dropping behind the
# helm. Lit from the top-left: a lit cap row, a light front, the shadowed lower back. Height by the crest dial: crest1
# F-34 ... crest4 F-37 at rest (man; the woman a row lower); no dial = crest3. The bob lag (STYLE_P2 25.4, the delight):
# its own channel `crest` (proposed clip key: crest=up on every walk and run frame that names tuft=up, the head rising
# after the bob) draws the plume a row lower, so it follows the head a frame behind; every other frame draws rest (a
# swing's tuft=- never hides it). Written by the area's crestgen.py from hand-drawn crest4
# masters (each height keeps the drawn cap; checked by eye at every height). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role helm form9
role helm band5
layer headwear
anchor head
keys crest
z 1
tags overlay
legend Q plume 0
legend R plume 1
legend S plume 2
legend T plume 3
legend U plume 4
legend Z linen 4
legend k linen 3
legend l linen 2
legend D linen 1
legend I glow 4

# (HELMS fix r1) begin T2 soft cap
# T2 soft cap: no comb on the soft cap (PLAN D74)
view D key rest when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view D key up when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view D key breeze when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view U key rest when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view U key up when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view U key breeze when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view R key rest when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view R key up when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view R key breeze when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view L key rest when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view L key up when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

view L key breeze when !helm.t3,helm.t2 replace
|.

# (HELMS fix r1) end T2 soft cap

# (HELMS wave 2 r4) the crest at T1: none (the ladder's T1 dials: no crest, no plume; T1 caps 2 rows): empty views
view D key rest when helm.t1,!helm.t2 replace
|.

view D key up when helm.t1,!helm.t2 replace
|.

view D key breeze when helm.t1,!helm.t2 replace
|.

view U key rest when helm.t1,!helm.t2 replace
